Aerie-Purpose: Make the sidebar side pref drive Helium right-aligned pref and the density pref drive the sidebar width (rail 56 px).
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/tabs (vertical_tab_strip_state_controller_impl.cc/.h, BUILD.gn)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #184. aerie.sidebar.side is the one source of the side; SyncAerieSide copies it to the Helium pref the layout reads.
SetTabStripRightAligned writes aerie.sidebar.side. The state width is aerie_sidebar::EffectiveWidth, so the rail is 56 px
without touching the saved width.

--- a/chrome/browser/ui/tabs/BUILD.gn
